triage: fix_game: The R3 test agrees with the rules: seat 1 at sum 7 calls and is strictly lowest, so it scores 0, and seats 2 and 3 score 8 and 20. The game ignored the scenario's given hands and dealt fresh 5-card hands inside round 1 (seat 1 got [10,10,6,6,10], sum 42), so CALL was never offered. R4 to R6 fail the same way, because the dealt hands overwrite the given ones.
