triage: fix_game: Several independent scenarios show the game file breaking clear, buildable rules. Discard offers are never put to other seats as claim options. The round-40 final showdown leaves every total at 0. The illegal-choice fallback does not discard the single highest card. Hands lose cards that were never chosen, for example [8,10,10,9,2] became [9,10,10]. These are implementation errors, not problems with the rules or limits of the platform.
