triage: revise_rules: The same failure repeated over five attempts: the match hit the 400-turn cap. The design is too long for the platform. With random play a CALL (hand_sum 7 or less) is rare, so matches run the full 30 rounds. Each round has three simultaneous polls (talk, first choice, claim), so with 5 players that comes to 30 × 3 × 5 = 450 answers, more than the cap.
